<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-102-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.43676" lon="-121.001272"><name>SC26-102-B</name><cmt>SC26-102</cmt><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 9.0 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 71/100; not catch probability. Center 141 ft; nearby 137–168 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-082</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.43995960021097" lon="-121.00124760191872"/><trkpt lat="35.439628312349285" lon="-121.00301831328032"/><trkpt lat="35.439278790146155" lon="-121.00368789036919"/><trkpt lat="35.43848051950638" lon="-121.00447869624355"/><trkpt lat="35.43847687824358" lon="-121.00425847423833"/><trkpt lat="35.43829665220818" lon="-121.0042629237995"/><trkpt lat="35.438289368526775" lon="-121.00382248088796"/><trkpt lat="35.43747835151166" lon="-121.00384250783607"/><trkpt lat="35.436838454040554" lon="-121.0033075401845"/><trkpt lat="35.43683481078744" lon="-121.00308732280816"/><trkpt lat="35.43638242414025" lon="-121.0029883444273"/><trkpt lat="35.43637878034545" lon="-121.00276812833562"/><trkpt lat="35.43582899146339" lon="-121.00223094945075"/><trkpt lat="35.435821700808134" lon="-121.00179052052452"/><trkpt lat="35.435279